<p>Hi <%= @interviewer&.full_name %>,</p>

<p>Please share your feedback on the candidate you interviewed.</p>

<table cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;">
  <tr><td style="color:#666;">Candidate</td><td><strong><%= @candidate.name %></strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#666;">Interview</td><td><%= @when_text %></td></tr>
</table>

<p><%= link_to "Give your feedback", @feedback_url %></p>

<p>It takes about a minute — an overall rating, whether you&rsquo;d recommend moving forward, and any comments.</p>

<p style="color:#666;font-size:12px;">This link is personal to you, so please don&rsquo;t forward it. No login is needed.</p>
